window.products.push({"id":811032,"name":"Tribeca Living 500ECEDPESSQUIV 500 Thread Count Cotton Percale Extra Deep Pocket Sheet Set, Queen, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zgBrjp8TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Woven of ultra-fine combed yarns with percale weave and luxury 500 thread count 100 percent cotton, these extra deep pocket sheets are available in a palette of soft and dark hues to coordinate with variety of bedding. These high quality sheets feature crisp percale weave crisp, cool hand feel and provide great durability while maintaining softness and appearance and stand up to years of use. Easy to care for and pilling resistant and breathable percale fabric for easier air flow perfect for all seasons and ideal for warmer months and areas. Carried in Queen King, Cal King and Full sizes and can be easily laundered at home, the sheet set includes two pillowcases, a generously sized flat and a fully elasticized deep pocket fitted sheet to accommodate mattresses up to 22\" deep.Note: This sheet set is woven of Percale weave. Percale bedding features crisp hand feel against your skin, tends to wrinkle more and do not feel as soft as Sateen weave, but tends to become softer with repeated laundering. If you like the shiny and lustrous feel of sateen sheets, then this may not be the right bedding for you. Wrinkling on these sheets can be reduced by drying on a low temperature setting, remove promptly from the dryer and folding or laying flat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zgBrjp8TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribeca Living","source_asin":"B01N6E8ZBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6E8ZBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6E8ZBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
