window.products.push({"id":811066,"name":"Liquid Bearings, The Superior 100%-Synthetic Oil for air Purifier and air Conditioner Fans, frees Rusty and Sticky mechanisms, quiets Noisy Fans, Neve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u1-HgFswL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"These are 1 oz bottles of Liquid Bearings. It is simply superior for all lubricating and corrosion-prevention uses on fan motors and anything else that needs lubricating, and it is virtually-odor-free, making it a pleasure to use. Because of their nature, petro-oils and lubricant sprays leave sticky deposits when they evaporate over time. In contrast, Liquid Bearings is made using a process that re-arranges the structure so all the molecules are uniform in size, shape, and weight, an ideal phenomenon which does not occur in nature. It is custom-designed to produce the ultimate lubricant, with inherent performance characteristics vastly superior to any petro-oil, and it never evaporates! In your older items, it is fully compatible with all vintage and current oils, and will flush away the residue of the evaporated petro-oil. You will easily notice that anything you lubricate with it will immediately move easier with Liquid Bearings, especially if you have been using petroleum-based oil on them for years. It is completely plastic-safe for all plastics, and will not harm any painted surfaces. The bottle is top-quality soft LDPE, and the pharmaceutical-grade stainless needle allows the application drop-by-drop, very precise. We also provide BOTH the standard ½” needle AND the longer 1-1/2” twist-on/off needles, each with its own tip scabbard for leak-proof storage. Liquid Bearings is also excellent for fishing reels, guns of all types, knives, electronic and audio equipment, model trains, slot cars, R/C equipment, watches, clocks, music boxes, locks and padlocks, bicycles, skateboards, roller skates, sewing machines, typewriters, and anything else you previously used petroleum-based oils or lubricant sprays on. We always offer a money-back guarantee! Try Liquid Bearings and you won’t be disappointed, GUARANTEED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u1-HgFswL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liquid Bearings","source_asin":"B00CNESRSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CNESRSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CNESRSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
