window.products.push({"id":811136,"name":"VOJACO Onion Slicer, Onion Holder & Finger Guards for Cutting, Stainless Steel Onion Slicer Tool for Slicing and Dicing Avoid Hurting, Onion Cutting T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sgfsCBEPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VOJACO devotes to bring high-quality and functional kitchen gadgets to every family. These multi-functional onion holder slicers not only allow easier and safer cutting and slicing, but also bring nice and even food slices. Bonus finger guard gives full protection to your fingers while slicing or cutting. Great kitchen tools that every family deserves. SPECIFICATIONS: Onion Slicer, Black ·Material: 304 Stainless Steel + ABS ·Size: 5.3*3.6 Inch ·Weight: 2.3 oz ·Color: Black Finger Protector for Cutting Food, Silver ·Material: 304 Stainless Steel ·Size: 2.5*1.7 Inch ·Weight: 0.6 oz ·Color: Silver Why choose VOJACO? ·High-Quality Material Our onion cutter is constructed by 304 stainless steel with thickened ABS handle, durable and rust-resistant, unlike other small light cutters that easily break off. ·Easy & Nice Cutting on Vegetables and Fruits Easy to use. Simply have the food and the onion holder firmly attached and start cutting, you will get nice and even cuts of food. For thin slices, you can slice every section; for thicker slices, you can skip one section. Perfect be used for cutting onions, tomatoes, potatoes, carrots and other vegetables; lemons, pineapples and other fruits; bacon, cheese, fish and other foods. ·Keep Your Finger Protected With our onion slicer, you could wave goodbye to risk having your fingers in the way of the knife. Besides, the handle of onion holder acts as a deodorizer to remove onion and garlic odor from your hands. ·10-Prong Meat Tenderizer These slicer holders can be used as meat tenderizer to process steak, chicken and tenderloin, making delicious fried meat or barbecue. Repeatedly stab the onion holder cutter into meat, making meat tender and seasoning easily penetrating. ·1 PC Onion Slicer + 1 PC Finger Guard You will get 1 pc onion holder slicer and 1 pc finger guard. Great kitchen tools for slicing or cutting!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sgfsCBEPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOJACO","source_asin":"B093PQGKMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093PQGKMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093PQGKMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
