window.products.push({"id":811154,"name":"Cloud9 Plastic-Free Vacuum-Insulated Double-Wall Thermal Stainless Steel Bottle with Tea/Fruit Strainer, 15 oz - 17 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-EgvN8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our promise to you: We are committed to offering products made with non-toxic materials to environmentally conscious consumers. Did you know that BPA-free plastics can still contain chemicals that are harmful to the body but are not yet regulated? We make sure your beverage never comes in contact with plastic. Function and Beauty: The Cloud9's stylish appearance, smooth surface, and rugged, eco-friendly construction make it a true standout. You’ll look and feel great with this exceptional bottle. The Cloud9's double walled, vacuum insulated construction ensures: Your cold drinks will stay cold and hot drinks will stay hot all day; the bottle will never sweat, or feel too hot or too cold to touch. Take it Everywhere: Hiking, camping, picnics, car trips, work, classes, or shopping! Fits car cup holders, exercise machines, briefcases, backpacks, and more. Fruit/Tea/Ice Strainer: Great for making fruit-infused water and large leaf loose tea. Place sliced fruit in the bottle, add ice, and fill with cold water. Snap infuser in place and enjoy all day long. For brewing tea in bottle, see our package insert. Cloud9 is also a Perfect Choice for: Juice, sports drinks, non-dairy smoothies, hot or iced coffee or tea, hot cocoa, water, and more. Care of Cloud9 is Easy: Just hand wash with warm, soapy water. Comes with a Limited Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-EgvN8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud9","source_asin":"B07256N523","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07256N523","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07256N523","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
