window.products.push({"id":811156,"name":"HerPro Microwave Plate Covers (2 Sets, Clear) & Plate Caddy (Red) Set | Anti-Splatter Guard, Lid with Steam Vents | Food Serving Tray | BPA Free and D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N4qqcDmYL._AC_SL1372_.jpg","description":"Have you ever burnt your fingers while trying to remove hot food from the microwave? You know it’s hot, so you tap your container several times to make sure it won’t burn you. The heat feels tolerable, so you slowly place your fingers on the container. But… it’s still so very hot! You can’t avoid it. Even if you use a microwavable dish for reheating your food, it still comes out hot. You don’t want to waste minutes waiting for it to cool, so you end using pot holders just to remove the container. With HerPro’s Microwave Cover and Plate Caddy Set, you will never have to worry about burning your fingers again! Now, you can reheat with ease because this set allows you to safely remove your food containers from the dreaded microwave. Our cover has multiple lid perforations that let steam escape, keeping the food moist. The set also includes a caddy that ensures your plates and bowls don’t slide around while being removed from the microwave. It also serves as a carrying item for transporting food from your kitchen to your dining table. Plus, our caddy is functionally designed to catch any messy spills and boil-overs that may occur on your turntable tray. This eliminates microwave clean up, making reheating convenient every single time. Here are more reasons to love HerPro’s Microwave Cover and Plate Caddy Set: ✅ The cover has vents in its lid to prevent steam buildup. ✅ Our cover protects against food splatter while cooking, and keeps food warm after cooking. ✅ The set is BPA and melamine free, and is top-rack dishwasher safe. ✅ The caddy can hold bowls with a height of 3 inches. Enjoy hassle-free heating. Add HerPro’s Microwave Cover and Plate Caddy Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N4qqcDmYL._AC_SL1372_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HerPro","source_asin":"B07NR8GK5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NR8GK5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NR8GK5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
