window.products.push({"id":811171,"name":"Villsure Ultra Soft Round Faux Sheepskin Fur Area Rug Pink Circular Shaggy Rug Round Fluffy Area Rugs Plush Circle Floor Carpet for Bedroom Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716uGRD3oaS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤【Ultra-soft & Skin-friendly】Made of 2.5-inch high soft and quality artificial animal fur, our faux sheepskin shaggy rug is designed to ease your tired feet and body and promote rest while providing superior touch against your skin. Moreover, our faux fur rug is made of fabric with hypoallergenic properties, it's perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies, staying safe for kids, pregnant and any sensitive person. ❤【Anti-slip Backing Design】Villsure faux fur rug has non-slip and wear-resistant backing with soft faux suede leather lining perfect for all floor surfaces. Due to its durable anti-slip bottom, our faux sheepskin rug can hold on the floor stably, create warmth and luxury home with our premium faux sheepskin fur bedroom rug. Please note：water underneath the rug may cause it to slip. Always keep the bottom of the rug dry and clean. ❤【Perfect Home Decoration】Villsure soft fluffy fur rug is a must-have home decor for draping over sofa, floor, chair or simply beside your bed or fireplace and step on soft fur rug makes your feet feel like in the cloud. It's also great decorative rug for children play, women yoga, reading in sturdy and add a luxury touch and warmth for your home. ❤【Easy to Clean】Our soft faux fur rug can be easily cleaned either with a hand-held vacuum cleaner and shake off outdoors to keep fluffy and soft. In cases of more stubborn spills or stains, gentle hand wash or spot clean is recommended, or machine wash on cold with laundry bag (please wash separately) for a deeper clean and let air dry flat, your faux sheepskin fur rug will come out looking like new! ❤【Ideal gift and Worry-Free Purchase】Our fluffy fur carpet is a perfect gift for friends and family-Birthday, Mother's Day, Children's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas. It also makes a great housewarming gift as well as a baby shower gift to bring warmth and comfort to your friends and family. Villsure faux sheepskin fur area rug provides 12 Months Friendly Customer Service. If you have any problems with our products, please feel free to contact us, we will do our best to assist with any problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716uGRD3oaS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villsure","source_asin":"B08YR4CK4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YR4CK4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YR4CK4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811172,"name":"SoyQuick Deluxe Tofu Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yoy1HBi8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Did you know that some of the best tasting tofu is homemade tofu and it cost much less than the tofu you buy in the store? Take control over the things you eat by making your own tofu with the SoyQuick Deluxe Tofu Kit and guarantee that you and your family are only eating fresh, organic, non-genetically modified tofu and feel confident that the only ingredients in your tofu are those that you have added yourself. The SoyQuick Deluxe Tofu Kit gives you unlimited flexibility to make all textures of tofu to suit the whole family's needs. By simply adjusting how long you press your tofu and the type of coagulator, you can easily make a wide variety of delicious tofu. Effortlessly make soft \"Silken\" tofu used for sauces, dressings and desserts like dairy free ice creams or press a firmer tofu for grilling, stir fries, baking and barbequing. The Tofu Kit's high quality 3 piece (5 X 4.25 X 3.5 inch) kit includes a large piece of cotton muslin, 20 packets of tofu coagulator and can make a 7-14oz brick of great tasting tofu using one batch of fresh home made soy milk and 1 packet of tofu coagulator for only pennies per batch! Unlike most wooden styles of tofu presses that are ideal conditions for bacterial growth and have hard-to-clean square corners, the SoyQuick Deluxe Tofu Kit is made of durable plastic with rounded corners which allow for quick and easy cleaning ensuring that there are no pieces of tofu left behind. The SoyQuick Deluxe Tofu Kit is also one solid piece which means that there is no more glue or nails to fall apart providing you with a life time of tofu making. Start saving your money now and make the texture and flavor of tofu you want from the comfort of your kitchen! For the best results, try using fresh soy milk made from the SoyQuick Premier Milk Maker 930P and even add herbs and spices while making your tofu for a fun twist to spice things up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yoy1HBi8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoyQuick","source_asin":"B002LZBNNA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002LZBNNA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002LZBNNA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
