window.products.push({"id":811186,"name":"Coleman 3Sixty Pour Insulated Stainless Steel Thermal Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D3yl+dNoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the 3Sixty pour performing up to 37 hours hot or 66 hours cold (with select models), you have every reason to stay outside a little longer. Not only have we mastered temperature retention, but we also added a 360 degree pour spout Interface that provides a smooth stream of liquids from any side. For on-the-go convenience, the half-turn knob allows for easy pouring from any angle, whether you're settling into a chair at your favorite campsite or rocking ever-so-slightly in your fishing boat. When securely closed, enjoy the peace of mind of a leak-proof bottle. The insulated lid doubles as a tumbler cup, making it even easier to cheers to the setting sun at the end of a long day of hiking. Finally, the double wall vacuum insulated stainless steel body keeps cool to the touch when hot, and it's sweat-proof when filled with cold liquids. Savor every last drop with the 3Sixty pour thermal bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D3yl+dNoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coleman","source_asin":"B076JXRP7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076JXRP7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076JXRP7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
