window.products.push({"id":811192,"name":"BALIBETOV Premium Yerba Mate Dust Remover I Mate Gourd Cup Accessory Reduces Bitterness and Acidity I Sugar Container Included (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+-rAQ7LXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An innovative Yerba container, made in Argentina with top-quality virgin plastic. A great gift for any Yerba Mate lover! Includes: 1 Despolvillador, Yerba container 1 Sugar container Each purchase is packed beautifully for the best taste and experience! WHAT IS A “DESPOLVILLADOR”? — In Spanish, the word “despolvillador” means dusting. This innovative accessory is a Yerba Mate dust remover. A container in which you keep your Yerba Mate and, with a light shake, it separates the dust from the Yerba. BENEFITS — The first of its kind! A must-have accessory for the best Mate experience. The removal of the dust from the Yerba reduces heartburn and other gastric discomforts caused by it. The solution for bitter Mates is here. Say goodbye to clogs in the Bombilla Straw. Take it wherever you go and enjoy your Mate all day! MODERN DESIGN — Holds up to 8 oz of Yerba Mate and is thoughtfully designed to connect traditional Mate lovers with the modern world. Great gift for any Mate lover! Available in 5 gorgeous colors. EASY TO USE & CLEAN — Made of top-quality virgin plastic, this Yerba Mate cup is designed to last. Watch the video for an easier understanding of its use. Instructions included. Measurements: 6.30 Inches Height X 2.35 Inches Width I 16 cm Height X 6 cm Width. BONUS — Includes a sugar controller. Add the perfect amount of sweetness and enjoy this natural and energizing beverage with all the benefits it offers! SATISFACTION GUARANTEED AND CUSTOMER SERVICE — If you need personal assistance on order information, shipping, or anything else, don’t hesitate to reach out. Your satisfaction is our main priority. Customer service WhatsApp number: +54 9 11 2341-3597 - We are available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+-rAQ7LXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALIBETOV","source_asin":"B084VV44PG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084VV44PG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084VV44PG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811193,"name":"S'well House Crests Water Bottle, 15oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JVTO-aPEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the creators of S'well, S'ip by S'well is playfully designed to bring charm and fun to your everyday water bottle and is the perfect way to let your personality shine through. The patterns and colors are designed to keep you sipping in style, with a S'ip bottle to match any mood, outfit or activity. S'ip by S'well is made from BPA-free double-walled food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, and sensibly tested for healthy hydration. Using S'well technology, our 10oz vessel will keep beverages cold and hot longer than your average bottle. Whether it's ice-cold water, fresh juice, or a steaming cup of hot cocoa, S'ip by S'well will keep your beverages hot or cold all day long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JVTO-aPEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S'well","source_asin":"B07G7XSTN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G7XSTN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G7XSTN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811194,"name":"Homykic Over The Toilet Storage, Bamboo 3-Tier Over-The-Toilet Space Saver Organizer Rack, Stable Freestanding Above Toilet Stand with 3 Hooks for Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wRh3tfzaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UTILIZE LIMITED VERTICAL BATHROOM SPACE - The perfect pick for small bathrooms, a 3-tier freestanding over the toilet storage unit helps keep your toiletries organized without taking up too much floor space, you don't have to bend over to get stuff under the sink anymore. OVER THE TOILET STORAGE - With the bottom shelf 35.6\" from the floor, this 24.8” W * 10.3” D * 66.7” H bathroom shelf organizer fits most standard toilets, easily fits into space behind your toilet. It is a great idea to tidy toilet papers, shampoo, shower gels, towels, hairdryers, and plants. With 3 removable hooks for convenience use. MULTIFUNCTIONAL ORGANIZER RACK - Clear clutter from your laundry room with this storage shelf, the open area for easy access, you can place daily things at eye level for taking at wills, such as detergent and basket. Or put flowers and plants on the balcony for viewing. DURABLE & DELICATE - Made with solid bamboo wood designed to last. The durable, smooth finish can well protect you from being scratched. Carefully crafted for universal appeal. ATTRACTIVE DESIGN - Storage is the basic, and innovative design is the key. It can make your bathroom and even your home unique, it is the perfect combination of modernity and nature. White, espresso, gray and natural colors also match with diverse home decoration with effortless cleaning and maintenance. STABLE CONSTRUCTION - 2 sets of anti-tilt kits for concerning security, protect the toilet storage shelf from waggle and topple over. Adjustable bottom bar for toilets of different heights. ASSEMBLY IS A BREEZE - We’ve made the assembly easier with clear instructions, and included tools, so you can set it up with no fuss, even if you're not good at handiwork. BAMBOO IS BETTER - Not only can it grow 3 to 4 feet a day, but the bamboo is as durable as solid beech or maple wood. It's a very strong kind of wood which is surprising given its gentle and delicate nature. Bamboo can be harvested in 4-5 years, which is more environmentally friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wRh3tfzaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B09BNB7QMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BNB7QMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BNB7QMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
