window.products.push({"id":811220,"name":"freedomlook Personalized Dog Uncle Mug, Dog Uncle Present, Dog Uncle Coffee Mug, K9 Uncle, Uncle Dog Owner, Dog Uncle Mug (11 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mEwVFmZiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recommended as the idea for Christmas gift, Mothers day, Fathers day, Valentine’s day, mugs for coworkers, kids mug, funny mug, unique coffee mugs, novelty coffee mugs. PRINTED ON BOTH SIDES. It doesn’t matter how you hold the mug, this awesome design will always be seen. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed. Your Satisfaction is our first priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mEwVFmZiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"freedomlook","source_asin":"B07NSZHYB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NSZHYB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NSZHYB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811221,"name":"ArtWall Starry Night by Vincent Van Gogh Gallery Wrapped Canvas Art, 36 by 48-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1wej0nekrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Wall's \"Starry Night\" by Vincent van Gogh 36x48 Gallery Wrapped Canvas. Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh has risen to the peak of artistic achievements. Starry Night is one of the most well known images in modern culture as well as being one of the most replicated and sought after prints. There are actually several main aspects that intrigue those who view this image and each factor affects each individual differently: 1. There is the night sky filled with swirling clouds, stars ablaze with their own luminescence and a bright crescent moon. Although the features are exaggerated, this is a scene we can all relate to and also one that most individuals feel comfortable and at ease with. This sky keeps the viewer's eyes moving about the painting, following the curves and creating a visual dot to dot with the stars. This movement keeps the onlooker involved in the painting while the other factors take hold. 2. Below the rolling hills of the horizon lies a small town. There is a peaceful essence flowing from the structures. Perhaps the cool dark colors and the fiery windows spark memories of our own warm childhood years filled with imagination of what exists in the night and dark starry skies. The center point of the town is the tall steeple of the church, reigning largely over the smaller buildings. This steeple casts down a sense of stability onto the town and also creates a sense of size and seclusion. 3. To the left of the painting there is a massive dark structure that develops an even greater sense of size and isolation. This structure is magnificent when compared to the scale of other objects in the painting. The curving lines mirror that of the sky and create the sensation of depth in the painting. This structure also allows the viewer to interpret what it is. From a mountain to a leafy bush, the analysis of this formation is wide and full of variety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1wej0nekrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B009R79C7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009R79C7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009R79C7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
