window.products.push({"id":811259,"name":"7\" Spiral Beeswax Tapers (set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ORGanoSNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"7 1/4\" high x 3/4\" wide Spiral Tapers (please note size, the base is smaller than a standard taper) (colors vary depending on where the bees pollinate and the time of year, Spring and Summer wax is usually lighter and Fall and Winter wax is usually darker) 100% Beeswax Candle Making Company hand poured and dedicated to making a great candle with no chemicals or artificial additives. We only use 100% Lead Free Cotton Wicks. They also have an amazing glow to the candle when burning. Do you know the benefits of beeswax candles... Did you know that beeswax candles clean the air when they burn? Beeswax releases negative ions when it burns. Pollen, dust, dirt, pollutants, and any other junk in the air all carry a positive charge, and that is how they can be suspended in the air. The negative ions released from burning beeswax negate the positive charge of air contaminants, and the neutralized ions are sucked back into the burning candle or fall to the ground. Many air purifiers and water filters harness this effective negative ion technology. Because beeswax candles clean the air and reduce indoor pollutants, they can effectively reduce asthma, allergies, and hay fever. One of the most rewarding parts of my candle pouring job is listening to customers tell me miraculous stories of how the beeswax candles changed their quality of life. The most common thing I heard was, “these are the only candles I can burn,” or “these are the only candles my husband will let me burn,” since the beeswax didn’t release irritating toxins and fragrances.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ORGanoSNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B076XL345Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076XL345Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076XL345Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811260,"name":"Doug and Cristy Designs Slatted Bottom Coffee Table White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":230.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFP4z5XgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lend rustic appeal to your space with this handsome coffee table. Construction with reclaimed wood makes this table a durable addition to your home, and a weathered finish ensures an easy fit in rustic or cabin decor. An expansive top gives you plenty of room for drinks and snacks, and a slatted bottom shelf provides storage for games, books, and other items.''To keep the genuine rustic look of this product we use reclaimed wood and we're always sure to make sure the surfaces are sanded smooth and splinter-free as possible. Please keep in mind that no two pieces will ever be the exact same. Also, old nail holes, knot holes, and cracks can be expected and are a part of what adds the character to these one-of-a-kind pieces. Natural wood tones may vary.\" Material: Reclaimed wood Finish: Distressed Style: Rustic Shelf: 1 Colors: Brown, white Handmade: Yes Dimensions: 17 inches high x 17 inches wide x 40 inches longThis beautiful Rustic Coffee Table has been built from naturally weathered reclaimed wood and comes with a roomy slatted storage deck underneath for storing books, magazines, and decor. Measures 40L x 20W x 18H with approximately 9-10 inches of storage height space underneath. This piece will add the perfect rustic charm to your space.To keep the genuine rustic look of this product we use reclaimed wood and we're always sure to make sure the surfaces are sanded smooth and splinter-free as possible. Remember, this is reclaimed wood so there is no way to ensure that the surfaces will be as smooth as new wood :)Each of our pieces is handmade with excellence and we guarantee you will receive the highest quality possible from the color finish to the structure and durability of its construction. You will love this piece!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFP4z5XgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doug and Cristy Designs","source_asin":"B087JDZKGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JDZKGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JDZKGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
