window.products.push({"id":811276,"name":"MAIPOR Vegetable Chopper - Onion chopper - Multifunctional 15 in 1 professional food chopper - Kitchen chopper - Dicer Cutter - veggie chopper with co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPzQ3RXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ 【SUPER HIGH QUALITY】– The onion chopper is made of high-quality food-grade ABS plastic, BPA-free, and durable. For better performance, we use super sharp 420 grade hardened stainless steel blades to chop/cut hard vegetables. The heavy-duty stainless steel blade is sharp enough, and the high-quality stainless steel blade can perfectly chop onions and tomatoes in an instant, or chop whole cabbage to make coleslaw. The vegetable cutter is a must-have for wives and mothers cooking enthusiasts. ✔【8 REPLACEABLE BLADES】 – The vegetable cutter has 8 interchangeable blades for slicing, shredding, grating and shredding. Cut into filaments and slices of different thicknesses. The built-in shredding cover can cut food directly into the 1.2-liter collection tray without messing up knives and cutting boards. The egg white separator and egg slicer can easily separate and slice the egg white and egg yolk. 1 hand guard to prevent finger cuts and 1 cleaning brush are destined to be your favorites. ✔【EFFICIENT PREPARATIONS】 – The newly upgraded multi-functional vegetable cutter, using traditional blades to chop and slice and dice takes a lot of time and effort. Like tomatoes, peppers, cabbage, cucumbers, onions, garlic, etc., the chopper tool can reduce the time of this process, so you will not have trouble cooking or cutting vegetables and fruits. This makes it easier to add vegetables to your diet, add diversified nutrition to your family meal, and never miss any important nutrition. ✔【KEEP CLEAN】– Use the container that comes with the multi-function shredder to free up space on the countertop. The dicing machine can be completely disassembled. Use a claw to scrape off the residue on the pressure plate, and the residue on the blade can be wiped clean. Safe and easy to use. No longer have to worry about cleaning and wiping. It can be easily cleaned in a few minutes by using the matching scrubbing fork. Its compact size allows you to store it almost anywhere. ✔【1 YEAR 100% SATISFACTION WARRANTY】 – Multi-function vegetable cutters and vegetable cutters should be carefully assembled or disassembled. Avoid using inappropriate blades to cut the food, otherwise the blade may bend or even be damaged. Ergonomically designed vegetable cutter. If you have any questions about our onion dicing machine, please feel free to leave us a message. We will do our best to follow up and help you at any time! wish you a happy life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPzQ3RXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAIPOR","source_asin":"B0C677C262","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C677C262","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C677C262","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
