window.products.push({"id":811306,"name":"Msake Portable Personal Mini Fridge, 8 Liter Compact Cooler and Warmer Refrigerator for Skincare Medications and Breast Milk Storage, 12V DC/ 110V AC ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q87I5VhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄ Compact size and lightweight: 8-liter thermoelectric mini-cooler and heated mini-fridge in a compact size. This compact unit measures 8 inches wide x 11 inches deep x 12.6 inches high (approximately 20.3 cm wide x 27.9 cm deep x 32.0 cm high) and weighs 7 pounds. The compact and lightweight design makes it easy to go anywhere and enjoy a snack or a cold drink without having to keep venturing out! Translated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version) 【Keep cool and keep warm】With a stylish LCD thermostat, it is easy to read and adjust the temperature of the mini-fridge. Refrigerator temperature range is adjustable from zero to 65 degrees So please note that it can not be used to freeze items, only to keep them cool or warm. Multi-functional and versatile: The removable shelf design is perfect for storing food, drinks, snacks, breast milk, insulin, medications, and skin care and beauty products. AC/DC adapter: This portable mini-fridge comes with a standard wall outlet (110-120V/AC) and a cigarette lighter in the car, which allows the appliance to be plugged into a cigarette lighter adapter (12V/DC) that can be used in the car. Environmentally friendly and warranty: 100% CFC-free and semiconductor cooling chips make the cooling and heating mini-fridge 100% environmentally friendly, and the advanced technology also gives you a quiet sound. SMAKE offers a 3-year warranty, so you can have confidence in this mini-refrigerator, and please feel free to contact us with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q87I5VhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Msake","source_asin":"B09WR328NY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WR328NY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WR328NY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
