window.products.push({"id":811442,"name":"VanderHome Sofa Slipcovers Quilted Sofa Protector Cover Non-Slip Armchair Covers Prevent Soiling Easy-Care Machine Washable(3 Seater White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cgIgfengL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SUITABLE SIZE: Sitting area length: One seater 22’’(55cm), Two seater 52’’(130cm), Three seater 75’’(190cm), Armrest length: 28’’(70cm). Sitting area width:24’’(60cm), Armrest width 24’’(60cm), Front width:15’’(38cm), Back width:40’’(100cm). Please check the atlas for accurate numbers and measurement method. ADVANCED PROCESS: Using high-quality polyester fiber as the surface material, not easy to wrinkle. Ultrasonic quilting make the product difficult to damage and non-woven fabric on the back can effectively minimize shifting. Polymer fiber as filler, the product can remain soft for a long time. GOOD PERFORMENCE: The product help you keep the furniture fresh and clean. You can sit together with your pet on the couch and share good times and food, drinks. It is waterproof, isolates dirt, makes it easier to clean, and keeps the sofa longer. EASY-CARE: You can easily wipe off food debris, pet hair and water stains without replacing it.It’s machine washable for easy care and maintenance, use separately in cold water during the beaut cycle, do not use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cgIgfengL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VanderHome","source_asin":"B07RP93D8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RP93D8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RP93D8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811443,"name":"Kilner Preserve Jars Set | 1L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kXs6kpkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the 'home of preserving', these traditional, ultra-reliable jars have spawned many imitations, but there's nothing quite like the real thing and we've been pleased to have them as part of our range for a little while now. But having half a dozen jars to fill all at once can be a daunting task so, to make it easier to work with a more manageable quantity, we're pleased to introduce our new packs of three. Established over 150 years ago and ideal for preserving jams, marmalades or chutneys, Kilner jars are tried, trusted and made to last. Whether you're new to preserving and making your first jars or a seasoned expert looking to add to your collection of equipment, our smaller packs are just the ticket. Featuring Kilner's patented 2-part lid, after heating the jar and lid in hot water, pop the wax-disc vacuum seal on the jar then place the outer metal band on the lid and tighten ... so easy to use and a real guarantee of long-term freshness. 1 litre","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kXs6kpkgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B005FDW52I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FDW52I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FDW52I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811444,"name":"Whiskware Egg Mixer with BlenderBall Wire Whisk 591 ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g020zhGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Whip up omelets, scrambled eggs, french toast mixtures, frittatas, quiches, and more with the Whiskware by BlenderBottle Egg Mixer. Simply add your ingredients, toss in the BlenderBall and shake. Features a built-in egg cracker, a removable egg separator, and a BlenderBall wire whisk From the Manufacturer BlenderBall Mixes as You Shake The Whiskware egg mixer uses a patented mixing system to deliver the fluffiest omelets, scrambled eggs and more. Inspired by the tried and true design of the wire whisk, the surgical-grade stainless steel BlenderBall whips air into the mixture as you shake, resulting in the fluffiest egg dishes An All-in-One Solution The Whiskware by BlenderBottle Egg Mixer is a simple, all-in-one solution for preparing just about any egg dish. Featuring a built-in egg cracker, a removable egg separator, and the BlenderBall wire whisk, it's got you covered Built-In Egg Cracker Keep your countertops clean thanks to the built-in egg cracker. Its unique design cracks the outer shell without breaking the membrane, and keeps drips inside the cup Removable Egg Separator If you prefer egg whites to the whole egg, you can use the removable egg separator to easily discard the yolk Surprisingly Large Capacity The Whiskware egg mixer mixes up to eight eggs, making it easy to whip up breakfast for the entire family Better Eggs & Omeletes Once you try an omelete or scrambled egg dish made with the Whiskware Egg Mixer, you'll never go back. Download the free Whiskware Recipe Box App and browse dozens of recipes for your new Egg Mixer About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Easy, Convenient, Effective How did you come up with the idea for this product? We saw an opportunity to make cooking breakfast faster, easier, and more enjoyable. We knew there had to be a better way to make fluffy, great-tasting egg dishes at home What makes your product special? The 3-in-1 tool can crack, separate, whisk and easily pour egg mixtures into the frying pan. Utilizing the patented mixing system, whip up light and fluffy egg mixtures What has been the best part of your startup experience? Whiskware by BlenderBottle is about challenging conventional methods of cooking to find a better way. We’ve tested hundreds of products, methods, and dishes, and are excited to share our innovations","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g020zhGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whiskware","source_asin":"B0C39DQ298","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C39DQ298","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C39DQ298","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
