window.products.push({"id":811466,"name":"HOME-X Stainless-Steel Cut and Serve Spatula, Multipurpose Kitchen Tool – 10.75” L x 1.75” W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dDKp7+NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you are trying to serve pieces of cake or sections of lasagna, reach for our Cut and Serve Spatula. It is made with stainless-steel metal, which is resistant to corrosion and extremely durable. We've also added a stainless-steel handle for a modern and clean design. The spatula has a serrated edge, so you can cut through pastry, cake, brownies, cheesecake, pizza, casserole, and other foods with ease. It can tackle crust and different textures within the same dish. Use the flat spatula to lift your slice out of the dish. The thin stainless steel has some flex to help you reach into the pan without messing up your dish. Instead of messy layers or just piles of food, get crisp and neat servings with our tool. We've added small slits in the spatula as well to help drain off grease or other liquids as needed. The entire design measures 10.8\" L x 1.8\" W x 0.75\" H, so the Cut and Serve Spatula stores easily within a utensil drawer or holder. The spatula can withstand hot temperatures to serve foods right out of the oven. To clean the spatula, you can throw it in the dishwasher or wash by hand. You will love having this slicer tool in your supplies. Our kitchen tool makes a great gift for friends and family members. Any recipient will appreciate its versatility and usefulness in the kitchen. It combines the best elements of a knife and server. Give the spatula for birthdays, Christmas, housewarming parties, weddings, bridal showers, and other special occasions. Order the HOME-X Cut and Serve Spatula today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dDKp7+NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08BK5NJ7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BK5NJ7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BK5NJ7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
