window.products.push({"id":811494,"name":"FIREBLAZE Electric Fireplace Eureka 26 inch - Curved Front Glass LED Fireplace Insert with Remote Control - Adjustable Heating, Sound, Brightness, Tim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mP+BLDczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A residence is only as welcoming as its ambiance. If your goal is to make your living area as snug and homey as possible, you have to get that atmosphere right. It has to draw you in and allow you to relax after a long day at work. The right design elements go a long way towards this objective. Our product, for instance, can help you establish that homely feel in your space. Create an inviting vibe in your abode with the FIREBLAZE Electric Fireplace Eureka 26! The Eureka 26 electric fireplace is a fantastic addition to any home. It features a curved front glass panel that displays realistic flames for a cozier experience. It can warm rooms of up to 400 sq ft in size. This stove insert can be set up either recessed into the wall from the outside or from the inside through in-mantel installation. What’s great about this LED fireplace is that you can adjust a wide range of settings. Access its control panel or use the included remote to shift between no heat, low heat (0.75 kW), or high heat (1.5 kW) settings. It has 4 levels for brightness, too. The fireplace generates a sound of crackling fire by default, though this is also something you can turn off. But that’s not all. We’ve also packed this electric stove insert with remarkable safety features. The product comes with quality overheating protection as well as a timer, which you can set from 30 minutes up to 5 hours. Turn up the coziness in your own home. Add the FIREBLAZE Electric Fireplace Eureka 26 to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mP+BLDczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIREBLAZE Where Warmth Begins","source_asin":"B0B1C6TCT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1C6TCT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1C6TCT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811495,"name":"Saad and sons Garlic Mincer, Rolling Chopper, Roller, Peeler, Crusher, Chef Kitchen Tools, Easy to Clean, Just Rinse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SQ+AfqXrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect tool for cutting garlic! ! ! It is easy to clean, the minced garlic will not stay in small holes or other places, just rinse after use. Novel design, convenient, labor-saving and fun. The material is strong, and the resin material is environmentally friendly and durable. Instructions: 1.Wash the Garlic Mincer. Peel off the garlic one by one, and remove the skin of the garlic. 2.At the beginning, you can put a garlic in first, and then close all the lids of Garlic Mincer tightly. 3.Use Garlic Mincer on a stable table 4.Grasp the part except the Garlic Mincer wheel with your hands and press the Garlic Mincer with a little force, so that all the covers of the Garlic Mincer are tightly buckled, and move the Garlic Mincer back and forth. 5.You will get garlic minced by Garlic Mincer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SQ+AfqXrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saad and sons","source_asin":"B09W2546FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W2546FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W2546FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":811496,"name":"New Jersey Map by Michael Tompsett, 14 by 19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YBgp5SPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful map of the state of New Jersey. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YBgp5SPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00EQYLXC0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EQYLXC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EQYLXC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
