window.products.push({"id":811521,"name":"GRASS DOG REPAIR SEED 2#","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cSMoCwabL._AC_.jpg","description":"Image shows front and back of the container. There has been some confusion on this recently. Each order is for 1 bottle. YELLOW PATCHES FROM YOUR DOG’S PEE RUINING YOUR LAWN? WELL, URINE LUCK! Fido pees on the grass and the nitrogen and acid in Fido’s pee turns the green grass yellow! Make the grass green again with Doggy Green Up! START SEEING RESULTS IN 3-5 DAYS! ALL NATURAL Made with earthworm castings (worm castings) Completely Safe for Kids & Pets Environmentally Friendly *Patent Pending Doggy Green Up! contains specialized microbes that break down uric acid and ammonia and converts them into a beneficial form of \"fixed\" nitrogen - helping your grass become healthier and greener. Directions for use: 1. Locate the \"dog pee grass spots\" 2. Remove any dead thatch - clip dead leaf tissue, don't pull the grass roots 3. Sprinkle about 1 cup of Doggy Green Up! per square foot of dog urine spot, making sure to completely cover the lawn spot 4. Water Generously 5. Add some of your favorite grass seed (optional) - you do not need to add grass seed for Doggy Green Up! to work. Doggy Green Up! fixes the problem and regrows the grass that is there, but many people like to add some grass seed to the process. Ingredients: BioSoil Farm worm castings, \"pup\"-prietary microbe blend, BioSoil Farm Recycled Plant Nutrients and micronutrients. A portion of all sales will be donated to local and regional pet charities and organizations. Doggy Green Up! fixes all types of lawn spots caused by Dog Pee, Over Fertilization, or excessive salts like road salt. Doggy Green Up! is made and packaged in the USA (Upstate New York) by workers working with disabilities. A great product made by some really great people.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cSMoCwabL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doggy Green Up!","source_asin":"B07FN52YXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN52YXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN52YXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
