window.products.push({"id":811595,"name":"5 PCS 9.8in Large Silicone Stretch Lids Safe in Microwave Dishwasher Refrigerator, Reusable Durable Expandable Food Covers or Bowl Covers to Keep Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HWEJin0LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specifications Material: Food Grade Silicone Size:9.8in(25cm) Color：white What's included: 5x 9.8in Silicone Stretch Lids Features -They are made from food-grade silicone and has the ability to stretch along with your containers creating an airtight seal. -They are circular in shape but fits effortlessly around oval, round, square, or even odd-shaped containers making the silicone stretch lids the perfect solution. -These lids can be used in the fridge, freezer, or even the microwave and dish washer safe! -The handy lids are perfect for your beans, soups,salads, fruits, and MORE. In fact all of your stored food will be kept fresher for longer! -The tags on the perimeter of the lids makes it easy to grip and pull the lids over whatever you’re wanting covered. How to use ? 1. Place half of the lid over one edge of the container. Start on the side closest to your body. 2. Stretch the other half of the lid away from you, inching the way around the bowl. 3. Stretch, then press the top of the lid while pulling the tabs to create a vacuum seal. 4. Pull the sides to ensure a perfect fit. Notice： Keep Dry Drying will increase the friction of the lid and make it easier to seal. Clean lids and keep them dry before the first use and after each use. Don't Fire Reusable Silicone Lids can be used in the microwave or oven, but are not suitable for placing on the gas or electricity directly for heating. Thermal Expansion and Contraction Safety You had better not completely seel container when you are using in Microwave or Oven, because the expanding heat and pressure from container, may result in damage or injury.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HWEJin0LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SNOMEL","source_asin":"B09D3QPJXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3QPJXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3QPJXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
