window.products.push({"id":811611,"name":"Bonzy Home Shoe Rack Storage Organizer for Entryway, 6-Tier Bamboo Solid Wood Shoe Shelf with Storage Shelf and Removable Hooks, Free Standing Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yuc17u0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY SHOE RACK - If you're having trouble finding shoes, it's time to start keeping them organized with a shoe rack like this. The large capacity-sized shoe shelf has room for organizing up to 24 pairs of your shoes. It can help you to save space and organize sneakers, high heels, boots, and slippers in your entryway, hallway, closet, living room, bedroom, mudroom, garage, etc. SPACE SAVING STORAGE - Dimensions: 39.4\" (L) x 11.4\" (W) x 39.2\" (H), height between shelves is 6.5\". The top of the shoe shelf has a container that offers convenient storage space for small stuff such as keys, flashlight, shoe cover, socks, shoe cleaner kit, and foldable shopping bag. 2 high grids (13.4\") to place your tall boots and galoshes. 4 versatile hooks to hang keys, umbrellas, sock bags, hats, etc. HEAVY BEARING WITH BAMBOO - The shoe racks are made of solid bamboo, which has better toughness and can withstand more weight than other wood of the same thickness. Its great load capacity can reach up to 55 lb. Each layer can hold 21 lb. So no matter what kind of condition our shoe rack presents, you don't have to worry about its bearing problem. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL FOR STORAGE NEEDS - The bamboo storage shelf is heavy-duty with extra support and no wobbling, it can also be a console table in the living room to put books, blankets, lamps, photo frames, baskets, and sundries. You can also place your favorite plants on the top layer. EASY TO ASSEMBLE AND MAINTENANCE - Comes with detailed and illustrated instructions and required tools for a worry-free assembly. Power tools should not be used to assemble this product. Wipe with a damp cloth to keep it clean. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and your problem will be resolved within 24 hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yuc17u0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonzy Home","source_asin":"B0B9SMFT5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9SMFT5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9SMFT5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
