window.products.push({"id":811888,"name":"Dosaze Contoured Orthopedic Pillow Neck Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping,Cervical Memory Foam Pillow,Ergonomic Orthopedic Sleeping Neck Support Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cu5OlrgHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛏【HPERYCAL HYPNOTIC NECK PILLOW】Special design on the pillow will make you feel sleepy soon after lying down and fall into deep sleep quickly. Proven contour design perfectly supports and aligns your head, neck, shoulder, and back. Bringing a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine. Improving sleep and pillow for neck and shoulder pain, relieves snore symptoms discomfort rejuvenating your body. KUIGUITEI ASKARRETERAPY 🌙【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】Hperycal contour pillows are well designed to support by following the natural curve of your body keeps air passages optimal for less snoring and more restful sleep allows you to completely wrap your neck while you sleep. The cutouts on the side give your top arm a place to rest and keep it at an angle so your pillow for neck and shoulder pain is not hunching over in front of you. 🛏【100% PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM PILLOW】Hperycal pillow for neck and shoulder pain core is made of high-density slow rebound memory foam. The memory foam rebounds contour pillow gently in 3 to 5 seconds and adjusts its firmness smartly by sensing the body temperature. That will provide sleeping firm support with amazing comfort and softness. Keeps its shape and firmness for long term use. THE MEMORY FOAM ITSELF WILL HAVE A VERY LIGHT SMELL, IF YOU ARE UNACCEPTABLE, PLEASE VENTILABLE IT FOR 3-5 DAYS. 🌙【COMFORTABLE ALL NIGHT】 This pillow for neck and shoulder pain comes with a double soft and breathable fiber cover. The dust-proof inner cover can effectively extend the lifetime of the pillow core. The outer cover is made of skin-friendly Polyester fiber, you can have a comfortable and cool sleeping environment. It is removable with zippered & machine washable. The high-quality zipper will not break even after being reused for a long time orthopedic pillow. LEVASTWINDYIDERREST 🛏【ADJUSTABLE! PERSONALIZED COMFORT FOR YOUR SLEEP STYLE】Tired of trying multiple pillow for neck and shoulder pain to find the right height? Need to replace pillows when your sleep needs change? Stop! Hperycal offers two different thicknesses for a custom feel, allowing you to enjoy a higher or lower contour by rotating the pillow 180 degrees. The removable insert at the bottom provides even more height options. Finally, a pillow that can be adjusted to your liking for every night's sleep! 🌙【REDUCE NECK & BACK PAIN】Proven contour design perfectly supports and aligns your head, neck, pillow for neck and shoulder pain, and back. The slope keeps your head from rolling out of a stable position. Bringing a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine. Improving sleep and relieving neck and shoulder pain, discomfort rejuvenating your body.THIS PRODUCT IS NOT A MEDICAL PRODUCT. IF YOU NEED TO USE IT FOR REHABILITATION, PLEASE ASK YOUR DOCTOR FOR ADVICE. 🛏【pillow for neck and shoulder pain】experience the cool and comfortable sleeping experience with hperycal's innovative memory foam and 3d mesh pillowcase. our 95% open cell memory foam pillow core and 3x more breathable pillowcase provide a cooling and dry night's sleep. our support pillows are non-toxic and odorless, certified by oeko-tex, certipur-us, and ispa. the special slow rebound memory foam won't change its shape and firmness due to the season. you deserve the best for a good night's rest! 🌙【INVEST IN YOUR REST & HEALTH!】Did you have a restless night with neck cramps and back soreness? According to surgeon Andrew Hecht, MD, the wrong pillow for neck and shoulder pain can worsen headaches, neck pain, shoulder and arm numbness. Our Hperycal neck pillow provides the curves, divots, and angles needed to relieve pressure with a more refined contour design. Suitable for side, back, and stomach sleepers, choose us for better sleep and a healthier future! 🛏【STOP! NO MORE NECK PAIN & SLEEPLESS NIGHTS!】Introducing Hypercal - the game-changer in the pillow for neck and shoulder pain industry! With a US patent and a unique hollow center design, it cradles your head, maintains natural cervical alignment, promotes good blood flow, and relieves muscle tension. Say goodbye to discomfort and hello to a good night's rest! 🌙【HASSLE FREE REPLACEMENT AND WARRANTY - NO NEED TO RETURN!】 You spend about one-third of your life sleeping, why not choose a pillow for neck and shoulder pain best for your sleep and health. It's expensive to do cervical rehabilitation by a physical therapist every day, but it's easy to enjoy pain-relief sleep every night! We promise our quality products and customer service. If you not enjoy the product, no matter refund or replace, no question asked, you will the solution at once! QAVGGTYOTH IDERREST","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cu5OlrgHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hperycal","source_asin":"B07K82JZXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K82JZXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K82JZXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
