window.products.push({"id":811999,"name":"MRQ Umbrella Clothesline, Clothes Drying Rack! Rotating Outdoor AND Indoor Rotating Clothing Laundry Rack. Portable Folding Drying Rack + Tripod + Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":120.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9O4X7RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>★<br></p> When there’s no room for an ‘in-the-ground’ umbrella clothesline inside your small apartment or around your tiny section; and you need portability with functionality, then tripod drying racks are handy to have. But you what’s even better? Spinning ones! Like this unique portable clothes dryer! <p>★<br></p> Other tripod dryer rack umbrellas are too small, too short and don’t rotate. But this one spins, with adjustable height and locking mechanism to adjust for room size or person size! Laundry day just became a little bit sweeter. Outside, stake it in the ground as the next best thing to a commercial clothing line. And inside, just spin your laundry towards you instead of reaching across a clothes horse <p>★<br></p> Take Your 5.3ft Clothesline Anywhere! Use the tripod inside, and the stakes outside and take your laundry drying rack on vacation, move it in to a small apartment as an indoor clothesline, or as a laundry line in a small backyard. The clothing drying rack packs up and down easy and fast, and to a compact 13”. We even give you a storage bag for your portable clothes line and one for accessories. <p>★<br></p> Hang More Clothes! Other similar umbrella racks give you 4 coat hangers. But we give you double the amount! Plus, you’ll get 7 lines per side, up to 42” long! You can finally stop ‘deciding’ what to wash this week, because you’ll have the space to wash it all with this spinning clothes drying stand <p>★<br></p> Nothing has been missed in the quality, from the more durable ‘screw-in’ stakes, thicker PVC line, taller, more heavy duty frame made from corrosion resistant anodized aluminum, locking mechanism, and the ability to spin! Hang more clothes, anywhere you want and access them easy with MRQ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9O4X7RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marc Reid Qualities","source_asin":"B08R5TR8DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-811999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R5TR8DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R5TR8DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
